  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...No hazardous weather expected through early next \nweek. \n\nDrier air will continue to push into the region from the\nnorthwest and north through tomorrow as high pressure builds\ninto the northwest. This high will move offshore over the\nweekend and keep the area dry. Seasonable temperatures expected\nthis afternoon and tomorrow.\n\nA northern stream upper level low will drop a reinforcing (and \ndry) cold front through region early Saturday, delivering extra\ncloud cover. Expect highs in the 70s (60s mountains) through \nTuesday and overnight lows in the 40s and 50s. Upper level \nridging persists through the middle of next week with a gradual \nwarming trend expected.",
